1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,440
好了 别动 宝贝
Okay, hold still, honey.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,440
我怕你又打到我身上
I'm afraid you're going to hit me again.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,020
别担心 我这次只练推杆
Don't worry. I'm just putting this time.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,800
我不是最厉害的高尔夫球手
I'm not the strongest golfer,

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,580
我觉得那拖累了我的生意
and I think it's holding me back in business.

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,280
真遗憾卖房合同不是在蹦床公园谈成的
Too bad deals aren't closed in a trampoline park.

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,140
我可以先屈体做一个鲁道尔夫
I'd just lazy-back into a Rudolph

8
00:00:15,182 --> 00:00:17,992
然后做个哥特夫斯 在公司一步高升
into a quadriffus right up the corporate ladder.

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,160
老爸 你今晚要来看我的歌剧吗
Hey, dad, you coming to my play tonight?

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,860
你的歌剧 你不过是个画布景的
"Your" Play? You only painted the sets.

11
00:00:24,293 --> 00:00:28,043
是啊 米开朗奇罗也不过画了西斯廷教堂
Yeah, and Michelangelo "Only" painted the Sixteenth Chapel.

12
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,160
或许你不该把脸凑得离油漆罐太近[毒晕]
Maybe don't keep your face so close to the paint cans.

13
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,860
抱歉 伙计 我要上高尔夫课
Sorry, buddy, I'm getting a golf lesson

14
00:00:31,903 --> 00:00:32,963
然后得和一位客户打球
and then I'm playing with a client,

15
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,560
但你下次表演我会尽力去看的
But I'll try to make your next performance.

16
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,400
-菲尔 -小忙哦
-Phil! - Little busy.

17
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,520
你总是这样
Oh, you always do this.

18
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:41,140
完全不动脑子就把东西塞进冰箱里
You cram stuff in the freezer without thinking about it.

19
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,680
我一打开门 冰冻的火鸡差点砸我脚上
I opened the door, and a frozen turkey almost fell on my foot.

20
00:00:43,904 --> 00:00:44,994
我老是打得偏左
I keep pulling it to the left.

21
00:00:44,994 --> 00:00:46,334
你确定这房子是水平的吗
Are we sure the house is level?

22
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,820
你一点都不感到抱歉吗
Are you not the least bit sorry?

23
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,140
我的脚趾头差点断了
I could have broken a toe.

24
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,020
亲爱的 我每天都要为一堆
Honey, I'm sorry for dozens of things

25
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,600
实际发生的事情道歉
every day that actually happen.

26
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:54,600
如果我连没发生的事情都要道歉
If I start apologizing for things that don't happen,

27
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,500
我还能干成什么事儿啊
how productive of a person would I be?

28
00:00:56,894 --> 00:00:58,814
你的高尔夫教授来了
Hey, your golf pro's here!

29
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,240
-大家好啊 -大家好啊
- Hola, hola. - Hello, everybody!

30
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,380
非常感谢你来给我上速成课 杰
Thanks so much for the quick lesson, Jay.

31
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,740
把我当作一块粘土
Just think of me as a blob of clay,

32
00:01:06,755 --> 00:01:08,635
静候你那经验丰富的双手
waiting for your experienced hands

33
00:01:08,635 --> 00:01:10,325
来爱抚 雕琢
to caress and coax me--

34
00:01:10,325 --> 00:01:12,245
高尔夫第一法则 别废话
First rule of golf-- shh.

35
00:01:12,245 --> 00:01:13,505
-好吧 -很好
- Okay. - Good.

36
00:01:13,505 --> 00:01:15,185
如果你打算这么臭脾气一整天
If you're going to be a grump all day,

37
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:17,100
当初为什么要答应来教他
why did you even say that you were going to teach him?

38
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,920
因为我那些外孙就靠他吃饭了
Because he's how my grandkids get food.

39
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:20,380
他在这啊
There he is.

40
00:01:20,765 --> 00:01:23,295
太感谢你答应照顾宝宝了
Ay, thank you so much for taking care of the baby.

41
00:01:23,295 --> 00:01:26,566
小卡让我帮他的歌剧打杂
Cam has me running all kinds of errands for the play.

42
00:01:26,566 --> 00:01:28,806
是吗 那你得时刻注意来电显示了
Yeah, well, you gotta keep your eye on the caller I.D.

43
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,180
我得去干洗店拿戏服
I have to go to the dry cleaners to pick up the costumes...

44
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:34,140
然后去拿干冰用来造雾
Then I have to go get the dry ice for the fog machine.

45
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,300
可能还得给小卡买些花
And maybe I'll go get Cam some flowers.

46
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:37,980
艾丽克斯可以帮你
Oh, Alex can help you with all that.

47
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,540
太棒了 好了 走吧
Oh, perfect. Okay, let's go.

48
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,580
我们不能迟到
We can't be late,

49
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:42,600
不然可就没有干冰 只能泪流满面了
or there won't be any dry ice in the house.

50
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,280
-说得不错 -什么
- Good one. - What?

51
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,760
你们都去好好玩吧 去吧 别担心
You guys have fun. Go on. Nothing to worry about.

52
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,620
我这里没问题
I got it handled here.

53
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,380
小心点
Be careful.

54
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,460
别担心 嘴巴张着就行
Don't worry, just keep your mouth open.

55
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:54,020
没事 真的没事
We're fine. It's fine.

56
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:10,300
好了 大家能静一静听我说吗
Okay, can I have everyone's attention, please?

57
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,020
罗本 我这里打个灯光
Reuben? Hit me with a spot.

58
00:02:12,658 --> 00:02:14,508
太刺眼了 放个粉色滤光板上去
That's a little harsh. Throw a pink gel on that.

59
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,660
太棒了 很好
That's great. Perfect.

60
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:18,820
好了 我会录下今天的排练
All right, I will be recording today's rehearsal,

61
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,920
但你们别在镜头前感觉不自在
but don't let that make you self-conscious.

62
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:23,420
我只会用这个来指出你们的错误
I'm only using it to pinpoint your mistakes.

63
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:26,640
第二 我让全体剧组成员
Secondly, I have granted full set access

64
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,460
都能见到莫琳·希克
to Maureen Schick,

65
00:02:27,749 --> 00:02:29,539
她今晚将来看你们的表演
who will be reviewing your show tonight.

66
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:30,940
完了 她很恶毒的
Uh-oh, she's vicious.

67
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,140
我们的前任音乐老师纳玛奇先生
Our last music teacher, Mr. Namagachi,

68
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,880
读了她的文章《烂得一团糟》 心碎难平
never recovered from her article, "Anything blows."

69
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,740
但公平地说 我看过那场表演
But in fairness, I saw that production,

70
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,640
女高音主角绝对是灾难
and the lead soprano was an absolute disaster.

71
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,840
无意冒犯 苏菲
No offense, Sophie.

72
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,800
你从那以后就全面绽放了 亲爱的
You've blossomed since then, sweetie, okay?

73
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,880
不要给她的麦克风装电池 好吗 很好
No batteries in her mic, okay? Great.

74
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:47,460
最后 马库斯·塔伯特
And lastly, Marcus Talbot.

75
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:49,880
伙计们 他感觉不太舒服
Guys, he's feeling a little under the weather.

76
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,180
不要怕 他在家养精蓄"嗓"呢
Fear not. He's home resting his instrument,

77
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,460
他今晚还是能登台表演
and he will be ready for the show tonight.

78
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:56,060
但现在需要一个替身来排练
But I will need a phantom for this rehearsal.

79
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,360
所以 谁上
So, anyone...

80
00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:58,460
我想我能试试
I guess I could help.

81
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,840
我不知道马库斯是怎么当上主角的
I don't know how Marcus ever got the lead.

82
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:02,540
但我知道他是怎么生病的
But I know how he got sick--

83
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:03,740
就因为他那矫揉造作的恶心表演
from chewing all that scenery.

84
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:05,880
现在是我从那个虚伪的冒牌货手中
This was my chance to earn it back

85
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,040
夺回主角的机会
from that insincere phony.

86
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:10,720
但首先 先为可怜的马库斯做个默祷吧
But first, a silent prayer for our fallen captain marcus.

87
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,280
祝好运 老朋友
Godspeed, old friend.

88
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:16,360
好无聊啊 他死了吗
This is boring. Is he dead?

89
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,680
没有 他没死 他在睡觉呢
No, he's not dead. He's just sleeping.

90
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,040
婴儿需要很多睡眠
Babies need to sleep a lot

91
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:22,300
才能长得更大 更强壮 更聪明
so they grow bigger and stronger and smarter.

92
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,220
邓太太好 露西你好啊
Hey, Mrs. D. Hey, Lucy.

93
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,840
每次都叫错
Every time.

94
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,760
T恤不错嘛
Well, that's a nice shirt.

95
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,580
谢谢 我自己设计的
Thanks. I designed it myself.

96
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:30,560
是最畅销的一款
It's my best seller.

97
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:33,340
我真嫉妒你的生活如此有目标
I'm so jealous you know what you want to do with your life.

98
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,180
我要是想你一样志向远大就好了
I wish I was inspired like you.

99
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:37,760
或者 目标更高远一些
Or, you know, aim higher.

100
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:39,740
你得去体验些新鲜事物
Open yourself up to some new experiences

101
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,400
然后发现什么
and find out what--

102
00:03:41,202 --> 00:03:42,792
-我的天 -你还好吗
- Oh, my g-- - are you okay?

103
00:03:42,792 --> 00:03:43,952
没事 只是
Fine. Just...

104
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:45,760
又踩到你爸该死的高尔夫球了
slipped on one of your father's stupid golf balls.

105
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,520
很好 你吵醒他了
Good, you woke him up.

106
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:49,120
他可能是饿了 我刚刚喂了他
Maybe he's hungry. I just fed him,

107
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,260
但我觉得奶粉总是比不上母乳
but I don't think bottles can live up to the real thing.

108
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,960
也许我能让他安静下来
Maybe I can calm him down.

109
00:03:53,063 --> 00:03:55,563
你真贴心 但他今天超级烦躁
Oh, that's very sweet of you, but he's super fussy today.

110
00:03:55,563 --> 00:03:57,593
宝宝一旦烦躁 他们 他们
And when babies are fussy, they--they...

111
00:03:59,980 --> 00:04:01,440
对啊 我超擅长哄宝宝的
Yeah, I'm good with babies.

112
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,780
你应该看他玩躲猫猫 他超级厉害
You should see him play peek-a-boo. He's amazing.

113
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,480
没有啦 只是不错而已
No. I'm good.

114
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:08,460
我认识一个芝加哥的家伙 他才厉害
I know a guy in Chicago-- he's amazing.

115
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,560
该死
Dang it!

116
00:04:12,774 --> 00:04:15,684
开什么玩笑 草皮像火箭一样飞出去了
Are you kiddin' me? That divot flew out of there like a rocket.

117
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:18,280
我决定对菲尔友好些
I decided to go gentle with Phil,

118
00:04:18,444 --> 00:04:19,544
那对我来说不容易
which didn't come easy to me,

119
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:21,280
因为一旦涉及运动
because I've always been a bit of a drill sergeant

120
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,240
我就变得像操练军士一样严格
when it comes to sports.

121
00:04:23,164 --> 00:04:24,064
但对于新宝宝
And with the new baby,

122
00:04:24,064 --> 00:04:25,844
歌洛莉亚总是埋怨我不够耐心
Gloria's been buggin' me to have more patience.

123
00:04:25,844 --> 00:04:27,564
拜托 他都好好存活一个月了
But come on. He's been alive a month.

124
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,440
支撑着小脑袋不掉能有多难
How hard is it to support your own head?

125
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,660
搞什么鬼
What the hell?

126
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:34,740
好啊 小伙子们
Hello, boys.

127
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:36,620
车不错啊 胡娇
What a sweet ride, Pepper.

128
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,760
你们在这里干嘛
What are you guys doing here?

129
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,860
我已经练习高尔夫几周的时间了
I've been golfing for a few weeks.

130
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,160
胡娇一直在教我
Pepper's been teaching me.

131
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,160
我从小就和我父亲一起打高尔夫
I grew up golfing with my father,

132
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:44,760
伟大的海亚姆·萨尔茨曼
the great Chaim Saltzman.

133
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,300
他在俱乐部广为人知的名字就是
Or as he was known around the clubhouse,

134
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:48,140
查德·特德维尔
Chad Treadwell.

135
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:50,320
我们该来一个"四人行"
Well, we should play together as a foursome.

136
00:04:50,385 --> 00:04:52,506
我第一次被这词吓着了 不过好吧
First time that word's creeped me out, but okay.

137
00:04:52,506 --> 00:04:53,436
你介意我增加点趣味吗
Care to make it interesting?

138
00:04:53,436 --> 00:04:54,946
我觉得你的裤子已经很够"趣味"了
I think your pants have already done that.

139
00:04:54,956 --> 00:04:56,236
赌100美元怎么样
How 'bout a hundred bucks?

140
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,440
我和菲尔对阵[玩弄]你和米奇
Me and Phil will play you and Mitch.

141
00:04:57,660 --> 00:04:59,240
行啊 米奇尔 你先上好吗
Fun. Mitchell, care to go first?

142
00:04:59,340 --> 00:04:59,960
我...
Oh, I...

143
00:05:00,596 --> 00:05:02,636
好的 我 我挥一个试试
Okay. Yeah. I'll-- I'll give it a whirl.

144
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,640
碰上我爸绝非偶然
Running into my dad was no accident.

145
00:05:05,206 --> 00:05:06,926
我天生就不擅长体育运动
I wasn't the best athlete growing up,

146
00:05:06,926 --> 00:05:08,856
而我爸绝不会错过任何一次
and my dad never missed an opportunity

147
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:09,960
指出这一点的机会
to point that out.

148
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:11,400
"扔的不错 南茜"
"Nice throw, Nancy!"

149
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,100
南茜是我们的邻居
Nancy was our neighbor.

150
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:15,420
我扔球永远不如她
I could never throw as well as she could.

151
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:18,500
我几乎放弃了在任何事上打败我爸的想法
I'd pretty much given up on beating my dad at anything

152
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,960
直到某天 胡娇把我拉到高尔夫球场
until Pepper dragged me to a golf course one day.

153
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,140
事实表明 我打得很好
Turns out I wasn't half bad.

154
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,260
经过六个月的练习
Six months' practice later,

155
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,040
我已经准备好打败我爸
I was ready to kick my dad's ass.

156
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:29,060
我都想好了打败他的过程
I knew just how I was gonna do it, too.

157
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:32,200
我会很紧张地走到球座旁
I'd walk up to the tee all nervous,

158
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,360
笨拙地练习几下挥杆
do a few clumsy practice swings,

159
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,020
然后直击球的中部
and then I'd hit that ball dead center,

160
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:39,600
目送它划过天际 直落在草坪之上
watch it arc through the sky, land on the green,

161
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,220
让我爸赞叹地喊出"哇"
and totally wow my dad.

162
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:43,580
噢不
Oh, no.

163
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:46,720
哇
Wow.

164
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:54,200
*夜的乐章 已经结束*
*It's over now, the music of the night*

165
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:57,520
好的 做得好 所有人
Okay. Great job, everyone.

166
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,660
谢谢你 但真是靠所有人的共同努力
Thank you. But it was really everyone.

167
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:00,900
为自己喝彩吧
Give yourself a round.

168
00:06:02,509 --> 00:06:04,049
马库斯的母亲 嘘
Oh, Marcus's mom. Shh.

169
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,080
祈求好运吧
Fingers crossed.

170
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,880
你怎么还没干完
Why is it taking you so long?

171
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,460
漆个墙面能有多难
How hard is it to paint a wall?

172
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,520
可比你们所谓的演唱难多了
A lot harder than your so-called singing.

173
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:14,580
至少墙漆出来就该是平的[音不准]
At least this is supposed to be flat.

174
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,360
我以前看过猴子漆墙
I once saw a monkey paint a wall.

175
00:06:16,620 --> 00:06:18,140
是吗 那你有没有说 "干得好 妈妈"
Yeah? Did you say, "Good job, mom"?

176
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:21,780
单核血球增多症 可他是我的主角
Mono? But he's my lead.

177
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:23,620
我的事业全靠这部剧了
My career depends upon this.

178
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:26,000
区政府差这么一点儿就要削减我的经费了
The district is this close to cutting my funding,

179
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,820
我的两根手指现在比划得很靠近
and my fingers are very close together right now.

180
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,420
-*夜晚* -让我和马库斯谈谈
- *Nighttime* - Just let me talk to Marcus.

181
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:31,430
-*加剧* -他绝不会背弃这些同伴的
- *Sharpens* -he would never turn his back on this company.

182
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,000
我们就像一家人一样
We are like family here.

183
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,940
*让人浮想联翩*
*Stirs imagination*

184
00:06:36,740 --> 00:06:38,340
不好意思 我们另想办法
I'm sorry. We're going another way.

185
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:42,320
*感官悄无声息*
*Silently the senses*

186
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:47,040
*放下它的防备*
*Abandon their defenses*

187
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:53,800
马库斯有什么消息吗
Any news about Marcus?

188
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:56,300
-你为什么小声说话 -保护嗓子以防万一
- Why are you whispering? - Saving my voice, just in case.

189
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,680
马库斯已经出局了
Oh. Well, marcus is out.

190
00:06:57,782 --> 00:07:01,012
幸运的是我在这里找到了一位更出色的魅影
But luckily, I found an even better phantom right here.

191
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:03,400
我不会说自己更好 不过既然你说了...
I wouldn't say better, but since you did...

192
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,740
卢克 我正要去问他
Luke. I was just about to ask him.

193
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:06,080
-卢克 -他了解剧情
- Luke? - He knows the show,

194
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:07,540
他唱得如夜莺般动人
he sings like a nightingale,

195
00:07:07,642 --> 00:07:09,962
而且他眼中有一种对戏剧的疯狂
and he has a certain theatrical madness in his eyes

196
00:07:09,972 --> 00:07:10,872
那是教不来的
you cannot teach.

197
00:07:10,872 --> 00:07:11,982
那是油漆造成的吧
That's just from all the paint.

198
00:07:11,982 --> 00:07:12,992
卢克
Oh. Uh, Luke?

199
00:07:12,992 --> 00:07:14,702
停下 你难道想吓到他吗
Stop it. Are you trying to spook him?

200
00:07:14,702 --> 00:07:15,672
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

201
00:07:15,672 --> 00:07:18,443
你批评完他画的布景 他就已经被你吓到了
He's already intimidated by you after you criticized his sets.

202
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,340
拜托 不会只有我一个人觉得
Oh, please. I could not be the only person

203
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:21,820
他画的独角兽会让人分神吧
that found his unicorns distracting.

204
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:23,880
让我先跟他说吧
Let me talk to him first.

205
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:26,120
要是我说服不了他 你再来
If I can't get the job done, then you step in...

206
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,420
现在的情况有点像替补演员
Kind of like the way an understudy

207
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,500
在主演出状况时候挺身而出什么的
would traditionally take over when the lead finds himself--

208
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:31,500
行了 去吧
Yeah. Just do it.

209
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,780
卢克 或者我应该叫你 魅影
Hey there, luke. Or should I say, phantom?

210
00:07:35,313 --> 00:07:36,103
你有话直说好吗
You wanna get to the point?

211
00:07:36,103 --> 00:07:37,674
因为我还有事要忙
'cause I'm kind of on a schedule,

212
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,480
而且那油漆味总让我闻着摔倒
and this paint keeps making me fall down.

213
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,260
马库斯出局了 小卡希望由你顶替他
Marcus is out, and Cam wants you to take over.

214
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:45,500
真的吗 所有的歌曲我还真都会
Really? Well, I do know all the songs.

215
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:47,600
不要试图让自己放弃 你一定要做
Stop trying to talk yourself out of it. You're doing it.

216
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:48,980
只不过两晚而已
It's only for two nights.

217
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,600
你又来了 只知道看消极因素
You're doing it again, looking at the negatives.

218
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:54,580
看好的方面 万一你没有搞砸
Look at the bright side. What if you don't screw up,

219
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:56,500
没有丢脸 或是被永远嘲笑
humiliate yourself, and get mocked forever?

220
00:07:56,694 --> 00:07:59,215
-我会被人嘲笑吗 -只是被那些酷小孩而已
- I'd get mocked? - Only by the cool kids.

221
00:07:59,215 --> 00:08:00,285
不过谁需要他们
But who needs them?

222
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,020
你现在已经属于我们的队伍了
You're one of us now.

223
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:03,060
歌剧奇客
The theater geeks.

224
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,840
*佛蒙特州雪满天*
*Vermont is snowy*

225
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,760
*拉斯维加斯太耀眼*
*Las vegas is showy*

226
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:13,800
*那就是我记得的大城市*
*And those are the capitals I remember*

227
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:16,980
如果这个放在楼梯最上一阶会怎样
what if this had been at the top of the stairs?

228
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,260
我一定会伤得很严重 对吧
I mean, I really could have gotten hurt, right?

229
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:21,160
对 莉莉 我给你做了午饭
Uh-huh. Lily, I made you lunch.

230
00:08:21,436 --> 00:08:23,066
花生酱 我的最爱
Peanut butter. My favorite.

231
00:08:23,066 --> 00:08:23,876
真难让人相信
It's just hard to believe

232
00:08:23,876 --> 00:08:25,636
居然有人会对如此显眼的
that somebody could be so oblivious

233
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:27,720
安全隐患视而不见
to a situation that is clearly dangerous.

234
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:31,000
看看我们 我们就像一个小家庭
Look at us. We're like a little family.

235
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:31,740
我知道
I know.

236
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:34,020
-我们是一对家长 -我知道
- We're the parents. - I know!

237
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:36,760
我知道他的反应一定是
I know what his response would be--

238
00:08:36,996 --> 00:08:39,447
"可你又没什么事 为什么要大发雷霆"
"But you're fine. Why you getting all bent out of shape?"

239
00:08:39,447 --> 00:08:41,067
不过万一我出了什么事呢
But what if I wasn't fine?

240
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:42,100
万一他一进家门
What if he walked through the door,

241
00:08:42,100 --> 00:08:44,920
就以为自己制造了一场可怕的事故呢
And he thought he had created a horrible accident?

242
00:08:45,467 --> 00:08:47,037
这可太好玩了
Oh, this is so fun.

243
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:49,080
太好了 她走了
Good. She's gone.

244
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,060
拿你的相机来
Grab your camera.

245
00:08:50,317 --> 00:08:52,537
我要再让他竖个小中指
I'm gonna make his little hand flip us off again.

246
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,440
不 不只我一个人
No, it's not just me.

247
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,960
三位妈妈一起办的这个派对
Three mothers are giving the party,

248
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:58,900
我们的名字都要在卡片上
and we need all our names in the card--

249
00:08:58,997 --> 00:09:02,798
歌洛莉亚·普里契特 莎拉·莱纳德 迪·乔
Gloria Pritchett, Sara Leonard, Dee Cho...

250
00:09:03,018 --> 00:09:04,328
什么叫没地方写了
What do you mean that there's no more room?

251
00:09:04,328 --> 00:09:05,848
迪·乔必须写上去
Dee Cho must go on.

252
00:09:05,968 --> 00:09:07,748
得了吧 那家伙显然是故意的
Okay, come on. That one had to be on purpose.

253
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,540
好吧 那我们等会到
Okay, we'll be there then.

254
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:12,840
他们还要一个小时才能做好
They won't be ready until one more hour.

255
00:09:13,448 --> 00:09:15,518
要不要换你来拿干冰
You maybe wanna take a shift carrying this dry ice?

256
00:09:15,518 --> 00:09:16,978
不要 我刚生完宝宝
No, I just had a baby.

257
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:18,500
我都看到你把曼尼扛上床了
I've watched you carry Manny to bed.

258
00:09:19,408 --> 00:09:20,719
我知道我们要怎么打发时间了
I know what we can do to kill time.

259
00:09:20,719 --> 00:09:22,819
我的灵媒就住拐角那里
My psychic is around the corner.

260
00:09:22,819 --> 00:09:24,799
求你告诉我你刚说的是"密友"
Please tell me you just said "sidekick."

261
00:09:25,089 --> 00:09:27,949
曾经我也以为我是无所不知的
I used to think that I knew everything, too.

262
00:09:27,999 --> 00:09:29,039
我们去算个命吧
We're going for a reading.

263
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,460
我先通知她我们马上就到
I'll let her know that we're coming.

264
00:09:32,540 --> 00:09:34,700
你逗我玩儿吧
You have got to be kidding me.

265
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:37,080
我是在想电话号码是多少
I'm trying to remember the telephone number.

266
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,620
我是怎么回事
What is happening to me?

267
00:09:41,070 --> 00:09:42,960
好吧 我们输了3杆了吗
All right, what are we, 3 strokes down now?

268
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:45,200
我觉得某人需要听听"胡言娇语"
I think someone needs a Pepper talk.

269
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:49,780
那怎么算是"胡言娇语"
How is that a Pepper talk?

270
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,620
你得愤怒起来 野蛮一点
You need to get angry. Play aggressive.

271
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:54,540
那男人几乎扇了你一辈子的耳光
That man's been mitch-slapping you and your entire life.

272
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:57,380
我知道 但是 他现在对菲尔真好
I know, but... he's being so nice to Phil,

273
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:59,500
而菲尔可比我糟糕多了
and Phil is way worse than I ever was.

274
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,060
我不知道
I don't know.

275
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:04,080
也许他不是曾经那个没有同情心的混球了
Maybe he's not the unsympathetic jerk he used to be.

276
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,460
好吧 你刚刚开局不利
Okay, so you got off to a rough start.

277
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:07,900
简要地说
Let's simplify.

278
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:11,140
在这一球 我要你把注意力集中在
On this shot, I want you to just concentrate

279
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:12,700
弯曲膝盖上
on bending your knees.

280
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,760
-懂了吗 -弯曲膝盖
- You got it? - Bend my knees.

281
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,100
弯曲--
Bend my--

282
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:17,840
见鬼 伸直膝盖
Dang it! Straighten my knees.

283
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,480
妈的 你就是个扶不起的阿斗
Son of a bitch, you're a hopeless embarrassment.

284
00:10:19,811 --> 00:10:22,612
你踢起来的沙子 比海龟下蛋踢得还多
You're kickin' up more sand than a sea turtle layin' eggs.

285
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,520
你看见了没
Did you see that?!

286
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,980
嗯 不算糟嘛
Yeah, that wasn't half bad.

287
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,420
嘿 抱歉刚才对你吼了
Hey, listen, I'm sorry I yelled.

288
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,640
不 不 不 我需要的就是这个
No, no, no. That's what I needed.

289
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:33,960
我大学时代的摔跤教练总是吼我
My old tumbling master in college used to yell at me all the time.

290
00:10:34,060 --> 00:10:34,820
那会让我变得更强
It just made me better.

291
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:35,840
-真的吗 -真的
- Really? - Oh, yeah.

292
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:37,540
他强烈侮辱我的男子汉气概
He'd say terrible things about my manhood,

293
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:38,960
他还拿粉袋扔我
He'd throw the chalk bag at me,

294
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:41,200
他奚落了我一整个夏天 让我变猛
He'd call me and taunt me over the summer to keep me sharp.

295
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,100
所以放马过来吧 杰
So bring it, Jay!

296
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,720
你太逊了 菲尔
You stink, Phil.

297
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,500
你是高尔夫史上 自允许穿短裤以来
You're the worst thing to happen to golf

298
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:46,900
最糟糕的存在
since they let people wear shorts.

299
00:10:48,363 --> 00:10:49,233
你刚刚让我--
You just told me to--

300
00:10:49,233 --> 00:10:50,733
不 流泪也是其中一部分
No, that's part of it.

301
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,280
听到了没
Did you hear that?

302
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,980
并且他不只是在训菲尔
And he wasn't just talking to Phil.

303
00:10:55,113 --> 00:10:56,433
他也是在训10岁的你
He was talking to 10-year-old you

304
00:10:56,443 --> 00:10:57,953
12岁的你
and 12-year-old you and...

305
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,840
去你妈的 南茜
Suck it, Nancy!

306
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,720
我只不过想帮帮忙而已
I was just trying to help.

307
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:05,600
打开心扉好好听
Just listen with an open mind.

308
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:07,840
她不相信灵媒
She doesn't believe in psychics.

309
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:09,320
不只是灵媒
It's not just psychics.

310
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,060
所有无法量化的现象我都不信
It's all unquantifiable phenomena.

311
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:13,040
我还是给你省点时间吧
I'm going to save you some time.

312
00:11:13,460 --> 00:11:14,940
她没有男朋友
She doesn't have a boyfriend.

313
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:16,960
可能现在没有 但很快就有了
Maybe not now, but soon.

314
00:11:17,544 --> 00:11:18,144
看到没
You see?

315
00:11:18,144 --> 00:11:19,424
-那说明 -嘘 继续
- That means-- - Shh. Go on.

316
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,680
你会遇见一个特别的人
You are going to meet someone special.

317
00:11:22,494 --> 00:11:24,885
我看到一个英俊的男人 骑着马
I see a handsome man on a horse,

318
00:11:24,895 --> 00:11:26,615
就像一位骑士
like a knight.

319
00:11:26,625 --> 00:11:29,395
我这个周末要去参加文艺复兴集会
Well, I am going to a renaissance fair this weekend.

320
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,480
是啊 我知道
Yes, I know.

321
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:31,780
根本就没有什么文艺复兴集会
There's no renaissance fair.

322
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:33,800
就算有 我也不会去
Even if there was, I wouldn't go.

323
00:11:33,945 --> 00:11:36,855
不然会成为小天文学家俱乐部的笑柄
I'd be the laughingstock of the young astronomer's club.

324
00:11:37,235 --> 00:11:40,265
可我不能告诉歌洛莉亚她的预言家是骗子
But I couldn't tell Gloria her fortune-teller was a fake...

325
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,640
至少在我找到更多乐子之前
Not until I had a little more fun.

326
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:45,580
我看到你笑了 你很享受哦
I see that you're smiling. You're enjoying yourself.

327
00:11:45,856 --> 00:11:46,796
我知道这听起来很疯癫
I know it sounds crazy,

328
00:11:46,796 --> 00:11:48,046
你能告诉我 在我5岁那年
But could you please tell me what happened to

329
00:11:48,046 --> 00:11:50,386
跑了的兔子"小纽扣" 它怎么了吗
myy bunny Buttons, who ran away when I was 5?

330
00:11:50,420 --> 00:11:52,200
根本就没有什么兔子 我讨厌兔子
Never had a bunny. Hate bunnies.

331
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:53,840
我看到一个农场
I see a farm...

332
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,360
有个红色的谷仓
with a red barn.

333
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,500
我知道谁在谷仓里
I know who's in the barn!

334
00:11:57,006 --> 00:11:58,746
那就像跟海莉玩拼字游戏
It's like scrabble with Haley.

335
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:01,380
玩了一会 你就是在和自己玩了
After a while, you're just playing against yourself.

336
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:03,840
好了大家 都打起精神
Okay, everyone, look sharp, please!

337
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,740
媒体过来了
The press is here!

338
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:07,320
如我所说 莫琳 我真的很沾光
As I was saying, Maureen, I was really at an advantage

339
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,700
我看过百老汇版本
having seen the broadway production.

340
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:10,760
我能从他们的错误里吸取教训
I was able to learn from their mistakes.

341
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,060
比如 在我的作品中
For example, in my production,

342
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:13,800
魅影在第一幕中出场
The phantom appears in the first scene,

343
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,940
因为它毕竟不是叫做
because after all, it's not called

344
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:16,420
"歌剧克里斯蒂和拉乌尔"
"Christine and Raoul of the opera."

345
00:12:16,767 --> 00:12:17,947
我有两个线人报告说
I have two sources telling me

346
00:12:17,947 --> 00:12:19,237
你的主角得了水痘在家休息
your lead is home with chicken pox.

347
00:12:19,247 --> 00:12:20,987
-是单核血球增多症 -那你就是第三个线人了
- Uh, mono. - Make that three sources.

348
00:12:20,987 --> 00:12:21,977
可恶 你真行啊
Oh, damn, you're good.

349
00:12:21,977 --> 00:12:24,487
我可以 私底下透露个消息吗
Um, permission to speak... off the record?

350
00:12:24,487 --> 00:12:25,287
不可以
Denied.

351
00:12:25,287 --> 00:12:26,818
好吧 那么
Okay, fine. Well, then...

352
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,440
你自己等着看吧
See for yourself in just a moment.

353
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,700
今晚将有巨星横空出世
Tonight a star will be born.

354
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,820
-小卡 -等等 曼尼 我在造星呢
- Cam? - Not now, Manny. I'm birthing something.

355
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:33,680
有时候在剧场里
Sometimes in the theater,

356
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,800
真正的戏剧在帷幕升起之前就上演了
the real drama happens before the curtain rises.

357
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:37,380
看好了
Observe.

358
00:12:39,628 --> 00:12:40,758
卢克·邓菲
Luke Dunphy,

359
00:12:41,078 --> 00:12:42,748
你要不要演卡梅隆·塔克拍的
How would you like to play the starring role

360
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:45,400
安德鲁·劳埃德·韦伯的
in Cameron Tucker's Andrew Lloyd Webber's

361
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,360
《歌剧魅影》的主角
"Phantom of the Opera"?

362
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:47,160
不想
Nope.

363
00:12:48,209 --> 00:12:49,799
卢克·邓菲 你拒绝的原因
Luke Dunphy, is it true you passed

364
00:12:49,799 --> 00:12:52,349
是你和蛮横的导演之间存在创意分歧吗
because of creative differences with an overbearing director?

365
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:53,580
别理那个挑事的记者
Say nothing to that jackal!

366
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:54,940
曼尼 怎么回事
Manny, what happened?

367
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:55,840
我尽力了
I tried my best.

368
00:12:55,940 --> 00:12:58,140
但他光是想想就已经喘不过气来了
He started hyperventilating just thinking about it.

369
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:00,800
我想有些人就是承受不了成为焦点的压力
I guess some people just aren't comfortable taking center stage.

370
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,640
好吧 也许我们可以给马库斯打一针
Okay. Well, maybe we can pump Marcus

371
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,240
那种给自行车手们打的东西
full of whatever they gave those bike riders.

372
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,240
他病得太重了
He's too sick.

373
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,820
但别担心 小卡 你会想到办法的
But don't worry, Cam, you'll think of something.

374
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:08,820
黎明前总是最黑暗的
It's always darkest right before the...

375
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:11,240
罗本 你能把聚光灯拿稳了吗
Reuben, could you keep that thing still?!

376
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,800
好吧 看来我们只有一个办法了
Okay, well, I guess we only have one option.

377
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:15,120
-我愿意 -什么
- I'll do it. - Hmm?

378
00:13:15,190 --> 00:13:17,160
我本来是想说自己来演的
I was gonna say play the role myself,

379
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:20,090
但我想还是该给孩子们一个机会
but, you know, I guess it really should be about the kids.

380
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:23,740
现在假设我被你爸的高尔夫球绊倒
Now if I had tripped on your father's golf ball,

381
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,340
比如...从楼梯上摔了下去
say... top of the stairs,

382
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,280
也许会...噢不
probably would have--oh, no!

383
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,600
碰掉几幅相框
Taken out some pictures.

384
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,760
瞧你干的好事 菲尔
Look what you've done, Phil!

385
00:13:29,981 --> 00:13:30,981
妈
Mom!

386
00:13:30,981 --> 00:13:33,041
没事 他总算睡着了
It's okay. It's finally sleeping.

387
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:35,120
我们来拍张合照吧
Hey, we should take a picture of all of us.

388
00:13:35,321 --> 00:13:38,121
一旦你摔下来 就控制不了自己了
Then once you get going, you know, you just can't stop.

389
00:13:38,121 --> 00:13:40,111
看见什么抓什么
You're taking everything down with you.

390
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:43,920
然后 为了让你爸清楚地知道
And then, to make it perfectly clear

391
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,080
到底是怎么回事
to your father what happened,

392
00:13:45,411 --> 00:13:46,461
我要把高尔夫球放在这里
I'll put the golf ball right here,

393
00:13:46,461 --> 00:13:48,071
因为有些人就是
because some people can't see the danger

394
00:13:48,071 --> 00:13:49,892
不亲眼看见就意识不到危险的存在
unless it's right under their nose.

395
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,760
养孩子真好玩
Having kids is fun.

396
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,080
也很容易
And easy.

397
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:57,140
也许我的人生目标就是相夫教子
Maybe this is what I should do with my life.

398
00:14:02,282 --> 00:14:05,522
他真是个小天使 我也想生一个
Oh, he's such a little angel. I want one.

399
00:14:05,522 --> 00:14:08,422
小点声 海莉 小家伙需要睡眠
Haley, little dude needs his sleep.

400
00:14:08,422 --> 00:14:09,352
我本想告诉海莉
I wanted to tell Haley

401
00:14:09,352 --> 00:14:11,663
太早结婚生子的危害有多大
about the dangers of starting a family too early,

402
00:14:11,663 --> 00:14:13,253
但我说什么
but what could I say

403
00:14:13,253 --> 00:14:17,003
能比婴儿的哭闹声更奏效呢
that couldn't be said better by a screaming baby?

404
00:14:18,293 --> 00:14:19,323
妈
Mom!

405
00:14:19,333 --> 00:14:20,683
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

406
00:14:20,683 --> 00:14:23,423
我也不知道我今天是怎么了
I don't know what's wrong with me today.

407
00:14:23,903 --> 00:14:25,393
-妈 -照睡不误
- Mom! - Still good.

408
00:14:25,393 --> 00:14:27,383
-抱歉 -你能离开这间屋子吗
- Sorry. - Would you just get out of here?

409
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:29,160
可以 可以 真抱歉
Yeah. Yeah. Totally sorry.

410
00:14:29,293 --> 00:14:30,344
我...
It's my--

411
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,160
抱歉
Sorry.

412
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:35,460
等他醒了 我们一起出去买冰激凌吃吧
When he wakes up, we should all go out for ice cream.

413
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,740
我也是这么想的
I was thinking the same thing.

414
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:41,840
你在干什么
What are you doing?

415
00:14:42,060 --> 00:14:43,400
不关你的事
Minding my own business.

416
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:46,560
等等 莉莉吃了冰激凌就吃不下晚饭了
Wait. Ice cream might ruin Lily's dinner.

417
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:47,420
所以呢
So?

418
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:50,040
我花了整个下午的时间做晚饭
So I spent all afternoon cooking.

419
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,640
我觉得去吃冰激凌比较欢乐
I thought ice cream would be fun.

420
00:14:51,645 --> 00:14:52,955
你一整天都在找乐子
All you've done today is have fun

421
00:14:53,100 --> 00:14:54,220
脏活累活都是我干的
while I did all the work.

422
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:56,500
我只是想尽量享受和孩子们在一起的时间
I'm just trying to make the most of it with these kids.

423
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,660
我不像你总能和他们在一起
I don't have as much time with them as you do.

424
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,120
所以你就溺爱他们是吗
What, by spoiling them?

425
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,980
是谁 谁给你发的短信
Who's that? Who's texting you?

426
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,180
只是工作上的事
It's just about work.

427
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,340
你总是这样 就算在家里也心不在焉的
Typical. Even when you're here, you're not here.

428
00:15:06,655 --> 00:15:08,725
吃个冰激凌你干嘛生这么大气
Why are you this upset about ice cream?

429
00:15:08,725 --> 00:15:10,135
你要是觉得我是因为冰激凌而生气
If that's what you think this is about,

430
00:15:10,135 --> 00:15:11,976
说明你根本没有听我说话
then you haven't heard a word I've said!

431
00:15:11,976 --> 00:15:14,506
我被你绕晕了 我们为什么要管这些孩子
I-I'm confused. Why do we even have these kids?

432
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:15,260
我不知道
I don't know!

433
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,300
我回家了
I'm going home!

434
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:17,780
太好了
Good!

435
00:15:22,466 --> 00:15:24,916
真"好"
Oh, fantastic.

436
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:27,880
离球洞还有最后一击
One stroke down on the final hole.

437
00:15:28,060 --> 00:15:31,020
真是个大推杆 真是个大大的推杆
It's such a big putt. Such a big, big putt.

438
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:34,160
我喜欢"大屁屁" 我无法否认
I like big putts, and I cannot lie.

439
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:34,760
说得好
Money.

440
00:15:35,017 --> 00:15:37,607
你知道什么很可悲吗 你努力地练习
You know what'll be sad? You doing all that practicing

441
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,560
就为了能击败你老爸
to finally be able to beat your old man,

442
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:40,860
结果还是没成功
And coming up just short.

443
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:41,980
我真是
I almost...

444
00:15:41,980 --> 00:15:43,520
不忍心看了
can't watch.

445
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:47,300
你该上了 高手
You're up, ace.

446
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,860
我和我爸也像他们这样
I was the same way with my father.

447
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,420
我们的关系总是很复杂
It's always complicated.

448
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,620
我和我爸没有 他什么事都支持我
Not for mine. My dad was just supportive.

449
00:15:56,808 --> 00:15:57,788
从没错过一场我的摔跤表演
Never missed a tumbling meet

450
00:15:57,788 --> 00:15:59,258
或是霹雳舞比赛
or a break-dance brawl.

451
00:15:59,258 --> 00:16:01,628
我如果为我们的学校集会设置音响系统
Heck, I'd set up the sound system for our school assembly,

452
00:16:01,628 --> 00:16:03,398
他一定是人群中声音最大的
he'd be the loudest voice in the crowd.

453
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:06,480
"各位 来瞧瞧我儿子的设备"
"Hey, everybody! Check out my son's equipment!"

454
00:16:06,958 --> 00:16:08,268
-哇 -是啊
- Aw. - Yeah.

455
00:16:08,358 --> 00:16:09,748
说真的 祝你好运
Hey, seriously, good luck.

456
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:11,260
你打得不错 我为你骄傲
You played good. I'm proud of you.

457
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:13,820
-真的吗 -我们应该多出来一起打球
- Really? - We should do this again sometime.

458
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:14,780
别听他的
Don't listen to him.

459
00:16:14,989 --> 00:16:16,089
他在对你施展"摇篮里的猫"战术
He's "Cat's in the Cradling" you.

460
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,920
-什么 -他在影响你的情绪
- What? - He's playing on your emotions

461
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:18,960
好让你失去斗志
so you lose your edge.

462
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:20,500
我也总那样对我儿子
I do it to my son all the time.

463
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:21,540
他刚刚是说他有儿子吗
Did he say "Son"?

464
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:23,160
是的 他是海豹突击队的
Yes. He's a Navy Seal.

465
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:25,380
我透露得太多了
Oh, I've said too much.

466
00:16:25,419 --> 00:16:26,589
"摇篮里的猫"是什么意思
What's "Cats in the Cradle"?

467
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,100
就是那首关于一个父亲的歌
You know, that song about the dad who misses

468
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:29,780
他错过了儿子人生中每个重要时刻
all the important moments in his kid's life?

469
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:30,860
你要坚强不屈
Stay strong,

470
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:32,640
就像我家凯尔在也门时那样
just like Kyle did in Yemen.

471
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:35,060
天呐 我真是个大嘴巴
Oh, my god, I'm a sieve.

472
00:16:35,490 --> 00:16:37,620
好了 米奇 上吧
All right, Mitch. Showtime.

473
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:39,000
五 六
Five. Six.

474
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:41,060
五 六 七 八
A-five, six, seven, eight.

475
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:44,020
好耶
Yes!

476
00:16:44,170 --> 00:16:45,770
一百块到手
A hundred bucks!

477
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:46,980
我们成功了
Oh, we did it!

478
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:49,660
我总算能买得起配这条裤子的上衣了
Now I can afford the shirt that matches these pants.

479
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:52,320
要去会所喝两杯吗
So... drinks in the clubhouse?

480
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:53,760
不行 我儿子在演出呢
Can't. My kid's in a play.

481
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:55,840
我约了个客户来再打一轮高尔夫
Yeah, I'm meeting a client for another round of golf.

482
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:58,240
你如果看到卢克 替我给他个拥抱好吗
Hey, if you see Luke, will you give him a hug for me?

483
00:16:58,260 --> 00:16:59,640
当然 我说真的
Will do. Hey, I was serious

484
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:00,860
我们改天一起打球
about we should play again sometime.

485
00:17:00,881 --> 00:17:02,261
想来挺傻的
It's a crazy thing

486
00:17:02,261 --> 00:17:04,301
如果你小时候我对你没那么严厉
that if I'd been less of a hard head when you were a kid,

487
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,840
这20年来 我们本可以父子齐上阵的
we could have had 20 years in this dumb game.

488
00:17:05,971 --> 00:17:07,421
不 我也有一半责任
No, it was half my fault.

489
00:17:07,421 --> 00:17:09,691
我以前内心太脆弱了
I mean, I-I used to be pretty sensitive.

490
00:17:10,461 --> 00:17:11,551
你真的没有对我施展
So y-you really weren't

491
00:17:11,551 --> 00:17:12,911
《摇篮里的猫咪》战术吗
"Cat's in the cradling" me back there?

492
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:13,600
当然没有
Of course not.

493
00:17:13,761 --> 00:17:15,982
你们说的这首歌 我怎么从来没听过
How have I not heard of this song you keep talking about?

494
00:17:15,982 --> 00:17:18,082
-不听也罢 太难听了 -太伤感了
- You have. It's the worst. - It's the schmaltziest.

495
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:18,740
难以忍受
Unbearable.

496
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:21,280
我回去的路上放给你听 我的iPod上有
I'll play it on the way back. I have it on my iPod phone.

497
00:17:22,332 --> 00:17:23,902
*摇篮里的猫咪*
*And the cat's in the cradle*

498
00:17:24,052 --> 00:17:26,062
*含着金匙出生*
*And the silver spoon*

499
00:17:26,062 --> 00:17:29,012
*小男孩很伤感 爸爸要出远门*
*Little boy blue and the man on the moon*

500
00:17:29,012 --> 00:17:30,192
*你什么时候回家 爸爸*
*When you coming home, dad?*

501
00:17:30,332 --> 00:17:31,972
*我不知道什么时候*
*I don't know when,*

502
00:17:32,132 --> 00:17:34,502
*但回来时父子便能相聚*
*But we'll get together then.*

503
00:17:35,102 --> 00:17:37,753
*回来时我们便能共度好时光*
*You know we'll have a good time then*

504
00:17:38,503 --> 00:17:40,553
我应该早点和你一起打高尔夫的 爸
I should have golfed with you sooner, dad.

505
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:41,840
我总是没空
I never made the time.

506
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,000
卢克
Luke!

507
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,360
我要打电话给我儿子
I need to call my son.

508
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:47,500
现在大马士革是几点
What time is it in Damascus?

509
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,700
我还是画张地图算了
Why don't I just draw them a map?

510
00:17:50,933 --> 00:17:51,923
准备好了吗 菲尔
Ready to play, Phil?

511
00:17:51,923 --> 00:17:54,473
我没空 卡尔 我儿子画布景的歌剧要开演了
I can't, Carl! My boy's sets are in a play!

512
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:59,060
我感觉到你认识的人
I get the feeling that something wonderful

513
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:00,500
最近碰到了好事
has happened to someone you know.

514
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,820
对 是曼尼
Yes, it's Manny.

515
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,220
他在学校歌剧中做主角
He got the lead role in the school play.

516
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:05,980
对 就是这个
Yes, that's it.

517
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:08,140
好吧 我觉得你已经取悦她一半了
Okay, I think you might have met her halfway on that one.

518
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:10,100
你们感觉到了吗
Do you feel that?

519
00:18:10,444 --> 00:18:12,534
一个鬼魂刚刚进入了房间
A presence has just entered the room.

520
00:18:12,534 --> 00:18:13,824
可能是空调的凉风吹过
Or the A.C. kicked in.

521
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:15,480
歌洛莉亚 我有话要说
Gloria, I have to say something.

522
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:16,760
是你的祖母
It's your abuela.

523
00:18:18,140 --> 00:18:18,860
哪一位
Which one?

524
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:21,200
她抽的是烟斗还是雪茄
Is she smoking a pipe, or is she smoking a cigar?

525
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,100
雪茄
A cigar.

526
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:23,660
是我的外祖母
My mother's mother.

527
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:25,920
我好想她
I miss her so much.

528
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:27,840
她说她也想你
She says she misses you, too.

529
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:30,900
我真希望她能见见我那刚出生的小儿子
I wish that she was here now to see Fulgencio Joe.

530
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,840
她见到了
She has seen him,

531
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,960
而且她说孩子好漂亮
and she says he is beautiful.

532
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:37,060
他的确漂亮吧
He is, isn't he?

533
00:18:37,740 --> 00:18:39,580
告诉她我爱她
Tell her that I love her.

534
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,640
她知道
She knows.

535
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,700
非常感谢
Thank you so much for that.

536
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,680
瞧见了吗
You see now?

537
00:18:47,700 --> 00:18:49,660
我想我都瞧见了
I think I do.

538
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:54,700
*夜之乐章*
*The music of the night*

539
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:56,560
曼尼 我问个问题
Okay, Manny, quick question.

540
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,960
你是忘了我说的要点
Did you forget the notes I gave you

541
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,120
还是选择无视它们
or just choose to ignore them?

542
00:18:59,336 --> 00:19:00,027
你这是做什么
Where are you going with that?

543
00:19:00,037 --> 00:19:01,217
前排要加个座位
We need an extra one up front.

544
00:19:01,217 --> 00:19:02,857
纳玛奇老师决定来看演出
Mr. Namagachi decided to come.

545
00:19:02,940 --> 00:19:04,520
你是说我顶替的那位不为人师表的老师
Oh, you mean the disgraced teacher I replaced

546
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:06,080
突然对这出歌剧有兴趣吗
suddenly has an interest in this production?

547
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,620
他正在停车
He's parking his peugeot right now.

548
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:09,660
哇 等着看我出丑的秃鹰正式杀到了
Wow, the vultures are officially circling.

549
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:12,020
曼尼 我就不隐瞒了
Okay, Manny, it's no secret

550
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:13,820
你并不是我的第一人选
that you were not my first choice for this,

551
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:14,740
也不是第二
or my second.

552
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:16,700
但现在对你来说还不算迟
But it's not too late for you

553
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:17,980
你还有机会唱出属于自己的魅影
to make this your very own phantom.

554
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,940
所以我要你看卢克的演唱
So I want you to watch what Luke did,

555
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:20,920
模仿就行
and copy that.

556
00:19:21,278 --> 00:19:25,278
*感官悄无声息*
*Silently the senses*

557
00:19:25,278 --> 00:19:27,828
-*放下它的防备* -他太出色了
- *Abandon their...* - He was glorious.

558
00:19:27,828 --> 00:19:31,048
每一个音符 每一处神韵 我如入天堂
Every note, every nuance... I was transported,

559
00:19:31,048 --> 00:19:32,278
我也无比生气
and I was furious.

560
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:33,760
但我不是生卢克的气
But my quarrel wasn't with Luke.

561
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,420
而是上帝
It was with god.

562
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:39,600
帮你姐占个座位
Save a seat for your sister.

563
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:42,520
抱歉 我想那是我的座位
Excuse me. I think that's my seat.

564
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:44,420
爸 你怎么来了
Dad! What are you doing here?

565
00:19:45,289 --> 00:19:45,919
开什么玩笑
Are you kiddin' me?

566
00:19:45,929 --> 00:19:47,779
这出歌剧里的布景是我孙子画的
My grandson paints the sets for a play,

567
00:19:47,779 --> 00:19:50,479
我岂有不从弗州开车来的道理
and I'm not gonna drive in from Florida, hmm?

568
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:51,820
这个座位有人吗
Is this one taken?

569
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,020
请坐
All yours.

570
00:19:54,460 --> 00:19:55,420
这件运动衫
That sweatshirt...

571
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,260
我是网球队的
I'm on the tennis team.

572
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:58,640
我们是山谷科学骑士队
We're the valley science knights.

573
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:00,800
骑士
The knights?

574
00:20:04,780 --> 00:20:07,260
*夜已深*
*Nighttime sharpens*

575
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:11,860
*感情升温*
*Heightens each sensation*

576
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:15,600
-什么 -*黑暗让...*
- What? - *Darkness stirs*

577
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:16,880
-那是卢克 -不会吧
- That's Luke. - No.

578
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:21,380
*心灵放飞*
*And wakes imagination*

579
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:26,091
*感官悄无声息*
*Silently the senses*

580
00:20:26,091 --> 00:20:29,371
-*放弃防备之心* -台上的本应是你
- *Abandon their defenses* - That could have been you out there.

581
00:20:29,371 --> 00:20:31,101
算了 那样不对
No, it wouldn't have been right.

582
00:20:31,281 --> 00:20:34,201
我肯定你还是可以唱对几个音的
I'm sure you would've gotten some of it right.

583
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:35,640
我不是这个意思
Not what I meant.

584
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:41,060
多谢你愿意在这里见我
Hey, thanks for meeting me here.

585
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:42,520
把生意与娱乐合二为一
No reason we can't mix business

586
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:43,720
并没有什么不好啊
with a little pleasure. Am I right?

587
00:20:44,612 --> 00:20:46,222
我只是很高兴能碰到一个人和我一样
I'm just excited to find someone who enjoys this sport

588
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,080
喜欢这项运动
as much as I do.

589
00:20:47,332 --> 00:20:49,542
我就开门见山吧 卡尔
I'm gonna be straight with you, Carl.

590
00:20:49,542 --> 00:20:51,042
你有不少资产要出售
You got a ton of inventory to move,

591
00:20:51,042 --> 00:20:52,772
你需要一个能干的地产经纪
and you're in need of a serious realtor.

592
00:20:52,772 --> 00:20:53,932
上去
Hup hup!

593
00:20:55,072 --> 00:20:57,032
在佣金方面 你有多坚持[稳定]
So how firm are you on your commission?

594
00:20:57,032 --> 00:20:59,272
我想你可以看出来 我相当有"弹性"
As I think you can see, I'm quite flexible.

595
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,880
说实话 菲尔 我喜欢你
I'll be honest, Phil, I like you.

596
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:02,460
我想我愿意与你合作
I think I'm ready to move forward with this.

597
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:05,080
真的吗 我太高兴了
Really? Well, I'm thrilled.

598
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:07,780
知道吗 我们这就定下来吧
Hey, you know, we could make this official.

599
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:09,200
表现得真好 儿子
Nice form, son!

600
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,360
别误会 我是指那份合同
I'm talking about that contract, of course.

601
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:13,240
你还是这么风趣 爸
You still got it, dad.

602
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:14,520
那是我爸
That's my dad.

603
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:15,340
你好
Hi.
